def move_institution_declarations(apps, schema_editor):
    """Move a declaration made on an accused institution with no person to the institution's own.

    It had no person to be about, so it was the institution's. Every active
    accused participant of that institution on the case takes it, as the
    party writes keep them; the row itself keeps it even when removed. A
    declaration on a person stays theirs.
    """
